  "你的故事落下了帷幕，但流淌在你后代血脉里的勇气，才刚刚开始新的远征。": "Your story has fallen, but the courage in your bloodlines is just beginning a new quest.",
  "你的朋友圈里全是雪山、草原与灿烂的笑容，孩子每次给同学看都满脸自豪。": "Your friends are surrounded by snow mountains, grasslands and bright smiles.",
  "你的每一次选择与世代传承，都将通向 12 种截然不同的生命哲学终局。": "Every choice and intergenerational transmission will lead to 12 very different life-philosophies.",
  "你的每一次选择正在将你塑造成截然不同的生物形态": "Every choice you make is creating a completely different form of life.",
  "你的环状染色体已完成复制。作为单细胞古菌，只要不死于意外，分裂便是永生。": "Your ring chromosome has been copied. As a monocellular fungus, division is immortal if it doesn't die by accident.",
  "你的眼部晶格发生精密重构，穿透迷雾精准锁定猎物！画布上你的头部亮起了深邃的感官光环。": "Your eye crystals have been condensed and locked in the prey through mist.! Your head on the canvas has a deep sense ring.",
  "你的细胞轮廓与碳酸钙纹层融为一体，成为地球生命改造星球的永恒铁证。": "Your cell contour is integrated with the calcium carbonate layer, and it becomes an eternal proof of life on Earth to transform planets.",
  "你的翅膀从雾蒙蒙的亚成虫变为晶莹剔透的成虫薄翼，三根修长尾丝在晚风中舒展！": "Your wings have been transformed from a mist-blind submersible worm to a crystal-creaked adult wing with three long tails stretching out in the late wind.!",
  "你的肋骨支撑起胸腔，第一口陆地空气涌入原始肺部，一个全新的大陆世界在你眼前展开！": "Your ribs support your chest, the first air of land pours into the raw lungs, and a whole new continental world unfolds in front of you.!",
  "你的胆固醇生物标志物在5.58亿年后被人类科学家检出，证实你是动物王国的先驱！": "Your cholesterol biomarkers were detected by human scientists after 558 million years, confirming that you were a pioneer in the animal kingdom.!",
  "你的背棘与齿尖泛起幽蓝的毒光，成为了食物链中最令人忌惮的带刺霸主！": "Your back thorns and teeth spread the venom of the blue, becoming the most disconcerting bayonet in the food chain.!",
  "你的螺旋象牙愈发粗壮，体型稳步迈向成年。": "Your ivory is getting thicker and your body is moving towards adulthood.",
  "你的躯体被阳光、微生物与洋流温柔分解，体内的碳、钙与氮原子重新进入土壤、大海与大气，正流淌在你的子孙后代与今日地球万物的血液之中。": "Your body is soothed by sunlight, microbes and ocean currents that the carbon, calcium and nitrogen atoms in your body re-enter the soil, the sea and the atmosphere, and are flowing into the blood of your children and of everything on Earth today.",
  "你的远见与底气，让孩子在未来的人生选择中从不必因贫困而妥协。": "Your vision and your background so that children never have to compromise their future life choices because of poverty.",
