  "你的遗骸在终结瞬间沉入了缺氧细腻的石灰泥或深海页岩。跨越亿万年时光，人类科学家将你完好无损的骨骼与羽印陈列在自然历史博物馆正中央，举世惊叹！": "Your remains sank into oxygen-depleted limestone or deep sea shale at the end. Over millions of years, human scientists have placed your intact bones and feathers in the heart of the Museum of Natural History, horrifying the world.!",
